      {
        "id": "dAkxXPUp8XQUKL9W",
        "title": "Designing an Automatic Machine",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>Did you notice that if you want to make your gripper open and close, you have to it yourself? You put in the numbers, and it closes or opens the gripper.</p><p>But coding can also help you do a bunch of things automatically.</p><p>For example, maybe you want to test a gripper to make sure it won&#x27;t break even if you use it for a really, really long time.</p><p>You don&#x27;t really want to sit for days and days and change one number so that it closes, and then change a number so it opens, and then change a number so it closes again, and then change one number so it opens again...It would be boring and take forever!</p><p>Instead, you can use code to make the gripper automatically open and close.</p><p></p><p>The sketch below has a drawing of a program. It&#x27; s just a starting point! Yours might look different, and you might have other ideas.</p><p><span data-slate-type=\"highlight\" data-slate-highlight-id=\"69d2febf-c8ef-4591-8c74-c981c9434095\">The goal is to design a program that automatically opens and closes the gripper.</span></p><p><span data-slate-type=\"highlight\" data-slate-highlight-id=\"ce83c637-d465-4e8c-8714-ec3ba345a4b3\">Drag the sketch  over to your workspace and show your idea.</span></p><p>It&#x27;s okay if you don&#x27;t know what the block is called or even if it actually exists! Once you have a design, it will be easier to adjust it based on the actual blocks.</p><p>Describe what you want the block to do, and where you would connect it. You might decide to delete or change some or all of the blocks that are there.</p>"
          ],
          "highlightedText": [
            {
              "id": "69d2febf-c8ef-4591-8c74-c981c9434095",
              "text": "The goal is to design a program that automatically opens and closes the gripper."
            },
            {
              "id": "ce83c637-d465-4e8c-8714-ec3ba345a4b3",
              "text": "Drag the sketch  over to your workspace and show your idea."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
